{"3869560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bound in a Nutshell in Infinite Space", "steam_appid": 3869560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bound in a Nutshell in Infinite Space</i> is a single-player first-person narrative horror game. While alone in a space station floating above the earth, a capsule with an injured woman from another station arrives. Explore the station, fix critical systems as they begin to fail, and discover the truth about what happened on the other station. Experience a deeply personal narrative exploring themes of isolation, deception, and vanity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869560/extras/a45577bcbc3150b30e30f2b998d0f05c.avif?t=1753713563\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the interior of the station in zero gravity, relying on handles to aid mobility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the station's exterior with your space suit's thrusters, keeping track of your slowly depleting oxygen and fuel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the truth about the disaster on the other station</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game created by a solo developer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of narrative mystery games like <i>Firewatch</i></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bound in a Nutshell in Infinite Space</i> is a single-player first-person narrative horror game. While alone in a space station floating above the earth, a capsule with an injured woman from another station arrives. Explore the station, fix critical systems as they begin to fail, and discover the tr